+{# Compressed policy: keep only enforced/actionable rules, drop verbose narrative. Full domain_policy is trimmed to reduce per-turn input tokens across all ~27 turns. #}
+You must follow these enforced domain rules on every turn:
+
+{{ domain_policy
+  | regex_replace('(?s)\n\s*\n\s*\n+', '\n\n')
+  | regex_replace('(?im)^\s*(note|example|for instance|background|context|rationale|explanation|overview|introduction)\b.*$', '')
